sequenceDiagram
  participant LLM
  participant Agent as V6Agent
  participant RAG as TFIDFRetriever
  participant KB as slowlog/docs
  participant State as AgentState

  LLM->>Agent: NextAction retrieve_rag
  Note over Agent: rag_query from LLM
  Agent->>RAG: Retrieve(ctx, rag_query)
  RAG->>KB: 5 Markdown docs embedded
  Note over RAG,KB: tokenize, TF-IDF, TopK
  RAG-->>Agent: KnowledgeChunk plus score
  Agent->>State: RecordRAG
  Note over State: summary and phase rag_done
  Agent->>LLM: next round PromptSummary
  Note over LLM: RAG plus tools then decide next action
